#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533110 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1575b61f-0d1c-5124-8694-4ce1d0966252" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{458}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533084} {:answer/id #uuid "27f9744c-3a01-5ff5-9439-9186460a5e89" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{290}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533085} {:answer/id #uuid "ba733d9d-17fb-5df7-9b58-0ff02201db1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{51}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533109} {:answer/id #uuid "d2e5300d-e4d3-52c5-8d88-acd7e3cd7237" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{51}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533111} {:answer/id #uuid "e14281c3-d653-50ea-a363-495ce1738e9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{170}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533114}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533109} :answer-field/id #uuid "3b6906a0-59cf-5f7c-95fc-dbca97580305" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533087}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "c17b2fe8-a547-5a52-92cd-f1dffb87eded" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $a=⟨-5,4,3⟩$ and $b=⟨1,-1,-4⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ -5 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -4\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{vmatrix}4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{vmatrix}i-\\begin{vmatrix}-5 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{vmatrix}j+\\begin{vmatrix}-5 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{vmatrix}k \\\\  & =(4\\cdot (-4)-3\\cdot (-1))i-((-5)\\cdot (-4)-3\\cdot 1)j+((-5)\\cdot (-1)-4\\cdot 1)k \\\\  & =-13i-17j+k \\\\  & =⟨-13,-17,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-13)^{2}+(-17)^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{169+289+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{459} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{51}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{3\\sqrt{51}}{2}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533112 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00a30d7b-fd93-58a8-906c-ad912d203351" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{481}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533083} {:answer/id #uuid "4a1ab39c-d6e4-51f2-a2c5-8faab7623717" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "6\\sqrt{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533093} {:answer/id #uuid "6b9a50b5-4356-52bb-81aa-a133a55de28b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\sqrt{157}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533100} {:answer/id #uuid "6e9a793b-f22e-5723-88b6-d66d411d8277" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\sqrt{481}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533102} {:answer/id #uuid "8a1be13f-d97b-5330-8103-6c74c8528d9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\sqrt{445}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533104}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533102} :answer-field/id #uuid "3d522e0e-82a9-50f9-8765-35d53a2b0cfe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533088}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "d4f09c3f-3240-516c-9c0f-7fc9fbf59517" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $r=⟨4,6,1⟩$ and $t=⟨2,6,-5⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\times t & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & 6 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -5\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{vmatrix}6 & 1 \\\\ 6 & -5\\end{vmatrix}i-\\begin{vmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{vmatrix}j+\\begin{vmatrix}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 6\\end{vmatrix}k \\\\  & =(6\\cdot (-5)-1\\cdot 6)i-(4\\cdot (-5)-1\\cdot 2)j+(4\\cdot 6-6\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =-36i+22j+12k \\\\  & =⟨-36,22,12⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,r\\times t\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-36)^{2}+{22}^{2}+{12}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1296+484+144} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1924} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{481}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{2\\sqrt{481}}{2}=\\sqrt{481}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533116 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4cdff164-9c10-5307-b70c-2f04f4e1f669" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{35}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533094} {:answer/id #uuid "58acee81-163c-5d99-be85-835f8c840a02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{10}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533095} {:answer/id #uuid "599f2164-d778-5b3f-958c-c13692e24761" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{34}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533096} {:answer/id #uuid "986ee716-53e1-5587-be39-666b7583b953" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{35}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533105} {:answer/id #uuid "9b125b61-7430-5b72-b48d-059cde3e3973" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{26}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533106}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533094} :answer-field/id #uuid "dc7e8718-61f5-5615-94c6-2b4a3db6804f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533113}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "ff6ee37a-5df7-5240-8139-6d8ab72c6503" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $r=⟨5,-5,-4⟩$ and $t=⟨2,1,-1⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\times t & =\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 5 & -5 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{vmatrix}-5 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{vmatrix}i-\\begin{vmatrix}5 & -4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{vmatrix}j+\\begin{vmatrix}5 & -5 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{vmatrix}k \\\\  & =((-5)\\cdot (-1)-(-4)\\cdot 1)i-(5\\cdot (-1)-(-4)\\cdot 2)j+(5\\cdot 1-(-5)\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =9i-3j+15k \\\\  & =⟨9,-3,15⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,r\\times t\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{9}^{2}+(-3)^{2}+{15}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{81+9+225} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{315} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{35}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{3\\sqrt{35}}{2}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534002 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19711b50-8807-59b7-acdb-8970429b0ef6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533199} {:answer/id #uuid "81206fce-7990-5565-942e-8da7f37d692c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533447} {:answer/id #uuid "8439ad9e-77a8-5942-943a-193cf7502f0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533449} {:answer/id #uuid "86ce9780-060e-5652-a984-02fffec1697a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533458} {:answer/id #uuid "afc268a2-7c3e-5206-99f6-7894f6937564" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{8}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533563}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533563} :answer-field/id #uuid "a12eb56b-c05a-51d2-a8e2-2e399e71b0cb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533902}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "4ad2c176-6641-542e-87e9-2e557825f205" :question/math-academy-id "q-129344" :question/problem "$$\n\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{\\sqrt{2x-y}-4}{16-2x+y}=\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Attempting to evaluate the limit by direct substitution leads to the indeterminate form $\\frac{0}{0},$ as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{\\sqrt{2x-y}-4}{16-2x+y} & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2(7)-(-2)}-4}{16-2(7)+(-2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{4-4}{16-14-2} \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, we can simplify the limit by first multiplying the numerator and denominator by the conjugate of the numerator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{\\sqrt{2x-y}-4}{16-2x+y} & =\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{(\\sqrt{2x-y}-4)(\\sqrt{2x-y}+4)}{(16-2x+y)(\\sqrt{2x-y}+4)} \\\\  & =\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{2x-y-16}{(16-2x+y)(\\sqrt{2x-y}+4)} \\\\  & =-\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{16-2x+y}{(16-2x+y)(\\sqrt{2x-y}+4)} \\\\  & =-\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{\\cancel{16-2x+y}}{\\cancel{(16-2x+y)}(\\sqrt{2x-y}+4)} \\\\  & =-\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2x-y}+4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the limit has been simplified, we can evaluate it:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\lim_{x\\to (7,-2)}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2x-y}+4} & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2(7)-(-2)}+4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{16}+4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4+4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{8}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the limit evaluates to $-\\frac{1}{8}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534217 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee433e2e-01a3-589b-be2a-e296c1083d5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "994" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534249}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534249} :answer-field/id #uuid "1293797e-50e4-52c1-9d9c-b8e13430af35" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534219}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "0e084855-b516-581f-ad22-fe3ead569b7b" :question/problem "If $$\n\\displaystyle R=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 7 & -2 \\\\ -6 & 2 & -6 \\\\ -6 & 6 & 7\\end{bmatrix},\n$$ then $det(R)=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}8 & 7 & -2 \\\\ -6 & 2 & -6 \\\\ -6 & 6 & 7\\end{vmatrix} & =8\\begin{vmatrix}2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{vmatrix}-7\\begin{vmatrix}-6 & -6 \\\\ -6 & 7\\end{vmatrix}+(-2)\\begin{vmatrix}-6 & 2 \\\\ -6 & 6\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =8(2\\cdot 7-(-6)\\cdot 6)+(-7)((-6)\\cdot 7-(-6)\\cdot (-6))+(-2)((-6)\\cdot 6-2\\cdot (-6)) \\\\  & =8(14-(-36))+(-7)(-42-36)+(-2)(-36-(-12)) \\\\  & =8\\cdot 50+(-7)\\cdot (-78)+(-2)\\cdot (-24) \\\\  & =400+546+48 \\\\  & =994\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534218 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ef9004f-9673-5d56-b880-e9fd7d88fc3d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-218" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534224}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534224} :answer-field/id #uuid "bb3b7366-e77f-5264-a6e0-bccb3caa1b1f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534240}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "10196cf2-c98b-5fbc-8825-8aa283507d40" :question/problem "If $$\n\\displaystyle Q=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -7 & 8 \\\\ 7 & 4 & 8 \\\\ 7 & -5 & 6\\end{bmatrix},\n$$ then $det(Q)=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}6 & -7 & 8 \\\\ 7 & 4 & 8 \\\\ 7 & -5 & 6\\end{vmatrix} & =6\\begin{vmatrix}4 & 8 \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{vmatrix}-(-7)\\begin{vmatrix}7 & 8 \\\\ 7 & 6\\end{vmatrix}+8\\begin{vmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 7 & -5\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =6(4\\cdot 6-8\\cdot (-5))+7(7\\cdot 6-8\\cdot 7)+8(7\\cdot (-5)-4\\cdot 7) \\\\  & =6(24-(-40))+7(42-56)+8(-35-28) \\\\  & =6\\cdot 64+7\\cdot (-14)+8\\cdot (-63) \\\\  & =384-98-504 \\\\  & =-218\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534226 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "89e81353-39ec-56ad-854e-d6993dbc1d69" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "321" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534235}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534235} :answer-field/id #uuid "f4677aae-c9f7-58da-8657-4eea065d1767" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534250}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "53d9a6a2-222e-5a82-86be-d90af27fc93a" :question/problem "If $$\n\\displaystyle H=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 7 & 3 \\\\ 8 & 5 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\n$$ then $det(H)=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}-7 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 7 & 3 \\\\ 8 & 5 & -2\\end{vmatrix} & =(-7)\\begin{vmatrix}7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & -2\\end{vmatrix}-2\\begin{vmatrix}7 & 3 \\\\ 8 & -2\\end{vmatrix}+(-2)\\begin{vmatrix}7 & 7 \\\\ 8 & 5\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =(-7)(7\\cdot (-2)-3\\cdot 5)+(-2)(7\\cdot (-2)-3\\cdot 8)+(-2)(7\\cdot 5-7\\cdot 8) \\\\  & =(-7)(-14-15)+(-2)(-14-24)+(-2)(35-56) \\\\  & =(-7)\\cdot (-29)+(-2)\\cdot (-38)+(-2)\\cdot (-21) \\\\  & =203+76+42 \\\\  & =321\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534228 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31d42a28-157c-5170-aa6a-49a8bd82a18d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-1381" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534223} {:answer/id #uuid "5e872c02-d7ba-5d56-8b04-ad2175720e48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-3535" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534227} {:answer/id #uuid "77c7d